  "content": {
    "id": "p28-q2-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "Express each of the following recurring decimals as a fraction:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$0.3333\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{3}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=0.3333\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}10x&=3.3333\\ldots\\\\x&=0.3333\\ldots\\\\9x&=3\\\\x&=\\frac{3}{9}=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$0.9999\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$",
          "worked": "Let $x=0.9999\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}10x&=9.9999\\ldots\\\\x&=0.9999\\ldots\\\\9x&=9\\\\x&=1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$0.2222\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{2}{9}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=0.2222\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}10x&=2.2222\\ldots\\\\x&=0.2222\\ldots\\\\9x&=2\\\\x&=\\frac{2}{9}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$0.3434\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{34}{99}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=0.3434\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}100x&=34.3434\\ldots\\\\x&=0.3434\\ldots\\\\99x&=34\\\\x&=\\frac{34}{99}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$1.5555\\ldots$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{14}{9}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=1.5555\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}10x&=15.5555\\ldots\\\\x&=1.5555\\ldots\\\\9x&=14\\\\x&=\\frac{14}{9}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$1.4\\overline{9}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{3}{2}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=1.4999\\ldots$. Multiply by $100$ and $10$ to align the recurring digits, then subtract.\n$$\\begin{align*}100x&=149.9999\\ldots\\\\10x&=14.9999\\ldots\\\\90x&=135\\\\x&=\\frac{135}{90}=\\frac{3}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 68
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$0.\\overline{89}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{89}{99}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=0.8989\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}100x&=89.8989\\ldots\\\\x&=0.8989\\ldots\\\\99x&=89\\\\x&=\\frac{89}{99}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$0.\\overline{123}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{41}{333}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=0.123123\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}1000x&=123.123123\\ldots\\\\x&=0.123123\\ldots\\\\999x&=123\\\\x&=\\frac{123}{999}\\\\x&=\\frac{41}{333}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 54
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$0.\\overline{4567}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{4567}{9999}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=0.45674567\\ldots$. Multiplying by $10000$ aligns the repeating blocks.\n$$\\begin{align*}10000x-x&=4567\\\\9999x&=4567\\\\x&=\\frac{4567}{9999}\\end{align*}$$\nThe fraction is in lowest terms.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-j",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "j",
        "prompt": "$2.\\overline{13}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{211}{99}$",
          "worked": "Let $x=2.1313\\ldots$.\n$$\\begin{align*}100x&=213.1313\\ldots\\\\x&=2.1313\\ldots\\\\99x&=211\\\\x&=\\frac{211}{99}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-k",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "k",
        "prompt": "$3.7\\overline{65}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1864}{495}$\n\nMultiply by $1000$ and $10$, then subtract to cancel the recurring digits.",
          "worked": "Let $x=3.76565\\ldots$. Multiply by $1000$ and $10$ to align the recurring digits, then subtract.\n$$\\begin{align*}1000x&=3765.6565\\ldots\\\\10x&=37.6565\\ldots\\\\990x&=3728\\\\x&=\\frac{3728}{990}\\\\x&=\\frac{1864}{495}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 78
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q2-l",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "l",
        "prompt": "$1.12\\overline{34}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{5561}{4950}$\n\nMultiply by $10000$ and $100$, then subtract to cancel the recurring digits.",
          "worked": "Let $x=1.123434\\ldots$. Multiply by $10000$ and $100$ to align the recurring digits, then subtract.\n$$\\begin{align*}10000x-100x&=11234-112\\\\9900x&=11122\\\\x&=\\frac{11122}{9900}\\\\x&=\\frac{5561}{4950}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 70
      }
    ]
  },
